msgid "USB FS device 包所有权与接入边界"
msgstr "USB FS device packet ownership and integration boundaries"

msgid "对象、资源与时钟"
msgstr "Objects, resources and clocks"

msgid ""
"controller 和 endpoint 保持独立 identity；公共 face 只有 readonly ops 与 context。 "
"装配拥有一个 controller、精确 endpoint 数组、精确事件环和一个显式 48 MHz clock "
"owner。实例共享只读方法表，没有全局可变 registry、endpoint 最大池、隐藏 worker 或必选 OS。未选实例不产生状态，MCU "
"热路径用 direct volatile MMIO。模型编译只 替换外部 MMIO/NVIC 叶端口，MCU 不携带模型函数表或运行时模拟分支。"
msgstr ""
"Controller and endpoint retain separate identities; public faces contain "
"only read-only ops and context. Assembly owns one controller, exact endpoint"
" array, exact event ring and an explicit 48 MHz clock owner. Instances share"
" read-only tables without global mutable registries, maximum endpoint pools,"
" hidden workers or mandatory OS. Unselected instances create no state, and "
"MCU hot paths use direct volatile MMIO. Model builds replace only external "
"MMIO/NVIC leaves; MCUs carry no model-function tables or runtime-simulation "
"branches."

msgid "SoC"
msgstr "SoC"

msgid "实际 48 MHz 来源"
msgstr "Actual 48 MHz source"

msgid "接入行为"
msgstr "Integration behavior"

msgid "STM32F407"
msgstr "STM32F407"

msgid "HSE 8 MHz / M8 × N336 / Q7"
msgstr "HSE 8 MHz / M8 × N336 / Q7"

msgid "验证现有 PLL/ready，只管理 USBFS gate"
msgstr "Validate existing PLL/ready; manage only the USBFS gate"

msgid "GD32F470"
msgstr "GD32F470"

msgid "HXTAL 25 MHz / M25 × PLLSAI N192 / P4"
msgstr "HXTAL 25 MHz / M25 × PLLSAI N192 / P4"

msgid "独占闲置 PLLSAI 与 CK48 mux 后有界启动"
msgstr "Bounded startup after exclusively owning idle PLLSAI and CK48 mux"

msgid ""
"GD32 原 200 MHz 主 PLL 的 Q9 输出不是 48 MHz，不能直接用于 USB。GD32 clock owner 拒绝新活跃 "
"USBHS/TRNG/SDIO/TLI 消费者，保留旁邻字段并从未修改 SYSCLK。clock owner 有 IDLE/CLEANUP/READY "
"与精确 consumer count；失败回滚缺少读回证明时仍保留 CLEANUP 责任。DCD 先 validate/retain，退出完成后 "
"release consumer，最后由外部 owner stop 时钟。pin/electrical/VBUS 和所有 clock-gated "
"隐藏消费者必须由外部资源 owner 先 授权并静止，不能仅凭 gate 为零推断系统独占。"
msgstr ""
"GD32's original 200 MHz main-PLL Q9 output is not 48 MHz and cannot directly"
" clock USB. Its clock owner rejects newly active USBHS/TRNG/SDIO/TLI "
"consumers, preserves neighboring fields and never changes SYSCLK. "
"IDLE/CLEANUP/READY and exact consumer counts track responsibility; failed "
"rollback without readback proof retains CLEANUP. DCD validates/retains "
"first, releases consumers after completed exit, and external owners stop "
"clocks last. External resource owners must authorize and quiesce "
"pins/electrical/VBUS and hidden clock-gated consumers; zero gates alone do "
"not prove system-wide exclusivity."

msgid "包完成与控制 epoch"
msgstr "Packet completion and control epochs"

msgid ""
"prepare 不访问 payload；拒绝 admission 不保留新引用。ACCEPTED 借用 request 与 payload，直到 "
"acquire-observed SETTLED。所有 request、payload、输出、count、 immutable clock ops 和 "
"wake target 均检查与 controller/endpoint/ring/clock state 及已有 loan 的重叠。拒绝 "
"state/read_events 输出别名时输出保持原值。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare never accesses payloads; rejected admission retains no new "
"references. ACCEPTED borrows requests and payloads until acquire-observed "
"SETTLED. Requests, payloads, outputs, counts, immutable clock ops and wake "
"targets are checked against controller/endpoint/ring/clock state and "
"existing loans for overlap. Rejected state/read_events output aliases "
"preserve outputs."

msgid ""
"事件环保存 value facts，满时不覆盖旧事件；精确软件 loss marker 排在原队列后。 最新 SETUP/epoch/closing "
"状态不依赖事件环空间。时间戳是 IRQ acquisition time， 不是 USB 总线采样时刻；reset 批次中的无序旧 SETUP "
"不计作新的已接收 control。"
msgstr ""
"The event ring retains value facts without overwriting old events when full;"
" exact software-loss markers follow existing queue contents. Latest "
"SETUP/epoch/closing state does not depend on ring space. Timestamps are IRQ "
"acquisition times, not USB bus sampling times; unordered old SETUP in reset "
"batches is not counted as newly received control."

msgid "取消、失败与完整停止"
msgstr "Cancellation, failure and complete stop"

msgid ""
"任务入口要求单一序列化特权执行者、Handler 外与 incoming IRQ masks clear。IRQ 保存/恢复 mask；一次最多消费八个"
" RX status、128 payload words 和八个选中方向。 冷热路径分开：cold reset/flush 有有限 poll "
"budget；IRQ flush 只发一次命令并读回， 从不在 IRQ 使用 cold poll loop。超时使用独立 monotonic "
"deadline，USB suspend 或 拔线后仍须由外部执行者调用 service，不依赖 SOF 或隐藏 timer。"
msgstr ""
"Task entries require one serialized privileged executor outside Handler mode"
" with clear incoming IRQ masks. IRQs save/restore masks, consume at most "
"eight RX status items, 128 payload words and eight selected directions per "
"call. Cold/hot paths are separate: cold reset/flush has finite poll budgets;"
" IRQ flush issues one command and readback, never cold polling in IRQ. "
"Timeout uses independent monotonic deadlines; USB suspend/unplug still needs"
" external executor service, not SOF or hidden timers."

msgid ""
"IN drain 先请求 SNAK、读到实际 NAK 状态，再请求 disable；EN clear、EPDISD、FIFO flush 和 W1C "
"clear 必须全部成立。OUT 非零方向先确认 global OUT NAK，再 disable 及排空 RX。drain 超时保留 "
"QUARANTINED，不能撤销 buffer loan。"
msgstr ""
"IN drain requests SNAK, observes actual NAK, then requests disable. EN "
"clear, EPDISD, FIFO flush and W1C clear must all hold. Nonzero OUT first "
"confirms global OUT NAK, then disables and drains RX. Drain timeout retains "
"QUARANTINED and never revokes buffer loans."

msgid ""
"Control OUT0 的 EPD 位固定为零，SETUP 也可绕过 NAK。不能模拟一个不存在的 disable ack 来完成取消。OUT0 "
"individual cancel 在缺少真实完成证明时保持 DRAINING，随后 QUARANTINED；用户可选择完整 device "
"stop。完整停止先读回 soft disconnect、global OUT NAK 与 DMAEN=0，消费 RX FIFO；随后关闭 "
"global/endpoint/NVIC sources 并 join 所有通知发布者，flush FIFO，再次验证 "
"disconnect/NAK/FIFO/IRQ 状态，才解除 OUT0 PIO loan、最后发布 SETTLED。OUT0 EP enable "
"此时可以仍为一，因为硬件只拥有内部 FIFO，已撤回的 PIO 执行者不再拥有 caller buffer；下一次 cold core reset 重新"
" 建立硬件状态。任一步证据缺失就返回 BUSY，并保留 caller storage 与 clock consumer。"
msgstr ""
"Control OUT0 EPD is permanently zero and SETUP may bypass NAK. Cancellation "
"cannot be completed by modeling a nonexistent disable acknowledgement. "
"Without actual completion proof, individual OUT0 cancellation remains "
"DRAINING then QUARANTINED; users may select full device stop. Full stop "
"reads back soft disconnect, global OUT NAK and DMAEN=0, consumes RX FIFO, "
"disables global/endpoint/NVIC sources and joins all notification publishers,"
" flushes FIFO, then rechecks disconnect/NAK/FIFO/IRQ state before releasing "
"OUT0 PIO loans and finally publishing SETTLED. OUT0 EP enable may still be "
"one because hardware owns only internal FIFO and withdrawn PIO executors no "
"longer own caller buffers; next cold core reset reestablishes hardware "
"state. Missing proof at any step returns BUSY with caller storage and clock "
"consumer retained."

msgid ""
"捕获 wake target 后 publisher count 仍保留该借用；stop/detach 在 notify 未返回时 拒绝 "
"BUSY。wake 必须同时支持 service/cancel 的 task 上下文和真正 IRQ 上下文， 绑定读取实际 priority/group"
" 验证 syscall ceiling，不修改全局 grouping。"
msgstr ""
"After wake-target capture, publisher counts still retain that borrow; "
"stop/detach returns BUSY until notify returns. Wake must support both "
"service/cancel task context and true IRQ context. Binding reads actual "
"priority/grouping to validate syscall ceilings without changing global "
"grouping."

msgid "证据与尚未建立的资格"
msgstr "Evidence and qualification not yet established"

msgid ""
"选定 ROM profile 与描述符"
msgstr ""
"Selected ROM profile and descriptors"

msgid ""
"描述符校验按给定完整长度扫描，不读取硬件、不复制或保留 descriptor；通过只表示 结构合法。选择哪段描述符、处理何种请求及 class "
"内容仍属外部策略。发送后， descriptor／reply 字节必须保持有效且不变，直到 outer request 的 acquire "
"SETTLED。"
msgstr ""
"Descriptor validation scans the full supplied length without reading "
"hardware, copying descriptors or retaining them; passing establishes "
"structural validity only. Descriptor selection, request handling and "
"class content remain external policy. Once sent, descriptor/reply bytes "
"must remain valid and unchanged until the outer request's SETTLED is "
"observed with acquire semantics."

msgid ""
"profile、endpoint 数组、face／ops、adapter、request 和 view／snapshot 元数据 须按其 C "
"类型自然对齐，地址范围不能回绕；非法对齐在 typed 访问前拒绝。 descriptor bytes 只需 byte "
"alignment。数值检查不证明任意地址或 opaque 私有 context 可访问；调用者仍须提供合法且保持有效的可读／可写存储。"
msgstr ""
"The profile, endpoint array, face/ops, adapter, request and "
"view/snapshot metadata must have the natural alignment of their C types,"
" and address ranges must not wrap; invalid alignment is rejected before "
"typed access. Descriptor bytes require only byte alignment. Numeric "
"checks do not establish accessibility of arbitrary addresses or opaque "
"private contexts; callers must still supply valid readable/writable "
"storage and keep it valid."

msgid ""
"可选 EP0 packetizer 与外层借用"
msgstr ""
"Optional EP0 packetizer and outer borrow"

msgid ""
"`nexus/components/usb_control.h` 使用调用者零初始化的 `nx_usb_control_t`，内部 "
"只有两个固定的 packet request 槽；outer `nx_usb_control_request_t` 与 payload "
"也由调用者提供。profile／face 的生命周期覆盖整个绑定的 adapter。应用独占 EP0 packet 使用权；event ring"
" 消费、class 分派及 controller 的恢复／停止仍由外部 owner 管理。现有 [FIG-16 I/O "
"装配与执行图](../assets/diagrams/README.md) 的 face→provider 是包层调用；EP0 "
"组件由应用执行者显式推进，不增加生命周期 owner。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus/components/usb_control.h` uses a caller-provided, "
"zero-initialized `nx_usb_control_t` containing only two fixed packet "
"request slots; callers also provide the outer `nx_usb_control_request_t`"
" and payload. The profile/faces must remain valid for the entire "
"lifetime of the bound adapter. The application has exclusive use of EP0 "
"packets; external owners still manage event-ring consumption, class "
"dispatch and controller recovery/stop. The face→provider edge in the "
"existing [FIG-16 I/O assembly and execution "
"diagram](../assets/diagrams/README.md) represents packet-layer calls; "
"the application executor explicitly advances the EP0 component, which "
"adds no lifecycle owner."

msgid ""
"prepare 同样仅允许 Task 调用；其余 adapter API 还要求同一个序列化特权 Task 执行，incoming IRQ "
"masks 须 clear；不允许第二 Task、ISR 或 callback 重入。 initialize 不启动硬件；prepare 不借用"
" payload，`nx_usb_control_begin` 按当前 权威 SETUP epoch 准入，成功才建立 outer "
"借用，且本身不提交包。IN 发送 min(length, wLength)，OUT 容量必须覆盖 wLength；请求、控制存储与 "
"payload 须满足公共头文件的对齐和不重叠合同。 `nx_usb_control_step` 每次最多调用一次 DCD "
"service、读取一次权威 state，并执行 一次 packet 提交／取消或 STALL 动作。它只检查两个固定 packet "
"槽，不在一步内循环 完成多包事务，也不创建 worker；调用者在 suspend、cancel 或停机期间仍负责推进。"
msgstr ""
"prepare is also restricted to Task context; all other adapter APIs "
"additionally require execution by the same serialized privileged Task "
"with incoming IRQ masks clear. A second Task, ISR or callback must not "
"reenter. initialize does not start hardware; prepare does not borrow the"
" payload. `nx_usb_control_begin` admits against the current "
"authoritative SETUP epoch, establishes the outer borrow only on success,"
" and does not itself submit a packet. IN sends min(length, wLength); OUT"
" capacity must cover wLength. Requests, control storage and payload must"
" meet the alignment and nonoverlap contracts in the public header. Each "
"`nx_usb_control_step` makes at most one DCD service call, reads "
"authoritative state at most once, and performs at most one packet "
"submission/cancellation or STALL action. It checks only the two fixed "
"packet slots, does not loop through a multipacket transaction within one"
" step, and creates no worker; callers remain responsible for advancing "
"it during suspend, cancel or shutdown."

msgid ""
"事实"
msgstr ""
"Fact"

msgid ""
"允许的结论与后续责任"
msgstr ""
"Permitted conclusion and subsequent responsibility"

msgid ""
"一个 inner packet acquire SETTLED"
msgstr ""
"SETTLED observed with acquire semantics for one inner packet"

msgid ""
"仅该包的 provider 已结束访问；DATA ACK 不完成整个 control 事务，也不返还 outer payload"
msgstr ""
"Only that packet's provider has finished accessing it; DATA ACK neither "
"completes the entire control transaction nor returns the outer payload"

msgid ""
"DATA 全部结束"
msgstr ""
"All DATA has finished"

msgid ""
"IN 按 MPS 分包，短于 wLength 且恰好落在 MPS 边界时发送必要的 DATA ZLP；OUT 进入 "
"DATA_READY，尚不发送 STATUS IN"
msgstr ""
"IN is split into MPS-sized packets and sends the required DATA ZLP when "
"it is shorter than wLength and ends exactly on an MPS boundary; OUT "
"enters DATA_READY without sending STATUS IN yet"

msgid ""
"对应 STATUS 包真实 ACK"
msgstr ""
"Actual ACK of the corresponding STATUS packet"

msgid ""
"可完成该 outer 事务的线上结果；已 acquire 的 STATUS ACK 先于随后观察到的新 epoch、closing 或超时判定"
msgstr ""
"The on-wire result of that outer transaction may complete; a STATUS ACK "
"already observed with acquire semantics takes precedence over a "
"subsequently observed new epoch, closing state or timeout decision"

msgid ""
"SET_ADDRESS staging 成功"
msgstr ""
"Successful SET_ADDRESS staging"

msgid ""
"仅暂存地址；STATUS IN 的实际 ACK 与 DCFG 地址写入／读回分别成立，线上成功不保证地址或外部 configuration "
"已提交"
msgstr ""
"Only the address is staged; actual STATUS IN ACK and the DCFG address "
"write/readback are established separately. On-wire success does not "
"guarantee that the address or external configuration has been committed"

msgid ""
"`nx_usb_control_out_view` 只在同 epoch 的 DATA_READY 且没有 provider packet "
"引用时， 提供 const 检查视图；outer 借用继续，视图在下一次同 owner adapter 调用时失效， 不能修改、释放或跨 "
"Task 传递。外部策略检查内容后调用 `nx_usb_control_approve`： true 才允许下一步 STATUS "
"IN，false 请求对旧事务 STALL。审批包含在原绝对 monotonic deadline 内；已被软件观察到的新 epoch "
"不接受旧事务的拒绝决定。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_usb_control_out_view` provides a const inspection view only in "
"DATA_READY for the same epoch with no provider packet references. The "
"outer borrow continues; the view expires at the next adapter call by the"
" same owner and must not be modified, freed or passed across Tasks. "
"External policy inspects the contents and then calls "
"`nx_usb_control_approve`: true permits STATUS IN at the next step, while"
" false requests STALL for the old transaction. Approval must occur "
"within the original absolute monotonic deadline; a rejection decision "
"for an old transaction is not accepted once software has observed a new "
"epoch."

msgid ""
"拒绝路径使用选定 ROM profile 的 `setup_decision`：它是一个 "
"`nx_usb_setup_decision_port_t`，仍由共享只读 ops 与既有实例 context 构成两指针 "
"face。`nx_usb_setup_reject` 在同一 IRQ 临界区内检查预期的已发布软件 SETUP "
"epoch、pending／closing 及两个 EP0 方向没有 active provider packet，再执行 STALL "
"命令并核对读回；旧 generic USB 方法表和 provider context 不增加字段。旧 epoch "
"的决定不对已观测的新软件事务产生 STALL 效果。这是已观测软件 epoch 的序列化合同，不是 USB 总线的物理原子事务。IRQ "
"尚未采集的 SETUP、主机重试和真实 wire 时序仍需实板验证；outer request 的借用不因拒绝、epoch "
"更新或临界区退出而撤销。"
msgstr ""
"The rejection path uses the selected ROM profile's `setup_decision`, a "
"by-value `nx_usb_setup_decision_port_t` two-pointer face formed from "
"shared read-only ops and the existing instance context. Within one IRQ "
"critical section, `nx_usb_setup_reject` checks the expected published "
"software SETUP epoch, pending/closing state, and the absence of active "
"provider packets in both EP0 directions; it then issues the STALL "
"command and verifies readback. No fields are added to the existing "
"generic USB method table or provider context. A decision for an old "
"epoch cannot STALL a newly observed software transaction. This is a "
"serialization contract for observed software epochs, not a physical "
"atomic transaction on the USB bus. SETUP packets not yet collected by "
"the IRQ, host retries and actual wire timing still require hardware "
"verification; rejection, epoch changes or leaving the critical section "
"do not revoke the outer request's borrow."

msgid ""
"地址策略显式调用 `nx_usb_device_address`，并在 step 刷新后检查权威 device state； "
"`nx_usb_control_snapshot` 只复制最近一次已获取的 state，不替代刷新，也不返还借用。 设备地址、closing "
"与外部 configuration readiness 不能从 outer SUCCESS 推断。"
msgstr ""
"Address policy explicitly calls `nx_usb_device_address` and checks "
"authoritative device state after step refreshes it. "
"`nx_usb_control_snapshot` only copies the most recently acquired state; "
"it neither replaces a refresh nor returns the borrow. Device address, "
"closing and external configuration readiness cannot be inferred from "
"outer SUCCESS."

msgid ""
"新 SETUP/reset 的 epoch、cancel、timeout 或 device stop 都不撤销旧借用。adapter 先 "
"acquire/fold 已完成 packet，再观察新 epoch；旧 packet 必须实际排空，才能最终 发布 outer "
"SETTLED。描述符字节、outer request、adapter context、profile 和其 endpoint face "
"在此期间保持有效；一个 outer 结束也不替调用者 join 独立 observer。"
msgstr ""
"A new SETUP/reset epoch, cancel, timeout or device stop never revokes an"
" old borrow. The adapter first acquires/folds completed packets and then"
" observes a new epoch; old packets must actually drain before it can "
"finally publish outer SETTLED. Descriptor bytes, the outer request, "
"adapter context, profile and its endpoint faces must remain valid "
"throughout this interval; completion of one outer request does not join "
"independent observers on the caller's behalf."

msgid ""
"如果 OUT0 packet 进入 QUARANTINED，adapter 暴露 `NEEDS_DEVICE_STOP` 并继续保留 outer"
" 借用。只有外部 controller owner 能授权 `nx_usb_device_stop`；adapter 不自动停止共享 "
"controller，不用 reset 或重初始化冒充排空。owner 执行实际完整停止 后仍须继续 step，以 acquire packet"
" 终态并结束旧 outer；缺少证明时继续保留存储。"
msgstr ""
"If an OUT0 packet enters QUARANTINED, the adapter exposes "
"`NEEDS_DEVICE_STOP` and retains the outer borrow. Only the external "
"controller owner can authorize `nx_usb_device_stop`; the adapter does "
"not automatically stop a shared controller or substitute reset or "
"reinitialization for drain. After the owner performs an actual full "
"stop, it must continue stepping to acquire the packet's terminal state "
"and finish the old outer request; storage remains retained without the "
"required proof."

msgid ""
"可选 CDC ACM 控制子集"
msgstr ""
"Optional CDC ACM control subset"

msgid ""
"`nexus/components/usb_acm.h` 使用调用者零初始化、自然对齐的 `nx_usb_acm_t`， 其中包含一个既有 "
"EP0 packetizer、一个 outer request 和七个 wire bytes。 调用者显式提供 communication "
"interface number、初始 line coding 和控制意图； 不创建实例池、任务、数据泵、UART 绑定或新的 "
"controller/endpoint face。provider 仍共享只读 ops；未引用 `Nexus::USBACM` 不保留类实例或 "
"archive 代码。 外部 dispatcher 独占安排 EP0 使用，并先处理标准请求和其他 interface/class。 "
"class-specific descriptor、capability 宣告、configuration readiness 和应用授权 "
"继续由外部工程负责；通用 descriptor helper 不验证 ACM 类语义。外部若宣告相关 class "
"capability，必须补足其全部必需的请求／notification 合同，不能仅凭这个 控制子集声称完整 CDC 合规。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus/components/usb_acm.h` uses caller-zero-initialized, naturally "
"aligned `nx_usb_acm_t` storage containing one existing EP0 packetizer, "
"one outer request and seven wire bytes. The caller explicitly supplies "
"the communication interface number, initial line coding and control "
"intent; no instance pool, task, data pump, UART binding or new "
"controller/endpoint face is created. Providers still share readonly ops;"
" without a reference to `Nexus::USBACM`, no class instance or archive "
"code is retained. The external dispatcher exclusively schedules EP0 use "
"and handles standard requests and other interfaces/classes first. "
"Class-specific descriptors, capability declarations, configuration "
"readiness and application authorization remain external "
"responsibilities; the generic descriptor helper does not validate ACM "
"class semantics. An external project advertising a class capability must"
" provide all its required request/notification contracts; this control "
"subset alone does not establish complete CDC compliance."

msgid ""
"仅支持 `SET_LINE_CODING`、`GET_LINE_CODING`、`SET_CONTROL_LINE_STATE` 和 "
"`SEND_BREAK`。`bmRequestType` 必须分别是 OUT `0x21` 或 GET 的 IN `0xa1`， "
"`wIndex` 必须完整等于选定 interface number；line coding 的 `wValue` 为零且 `wLength` "
"恰为 `7`，control-line 与 break 的 `wLength` 为零，control-line 只允许 DTR/RTS "
"两位。未知或字段不符的请求通过已有 software-epoch guarded reject 明确 STALL；如果 guarded "
"reject 返回 BUSY/STATE/IO 等错误，不能声称 拒绝已经执行。外部不应将其他合法类请求误派给这个窄子集。"
msgstr ""
"Only `SET_LINE_CODING`, `GET_LINE_CODING`, `SET_CONTROL_LINE_STATE` and "
"`SEND_BREAK` are supported. `bmRequestType` must be OUT `0x21`, or IN "
"`0xa1` for GET. The complete `wIndex` must equal the selected interface "
"number. Line coding requires zero `wValue` and `wLength` of exactly `7`;"
" control-line and break requests require zero `wLength`, and "
"control-line permits only the two DTR/RTS bits. Unknown requests or "
"malformed fields are explicitly stalled through the existing "
"software-epoch guarded rejection. If guarded rejection returns an error "
"such as BUSY/STATE/IO, rejection cannot be reported as completed. "
"External dispatch must not misroute other valid class requests to this "
"narrow subset."

msgid ""
"`SET_LINE_CODING` 先接收七字节暂存到 DATA_READY， `nx_usb_acm_pending` "
"仅复制值供外部检查。线编码的共享格式检查只接受非零 rate、 stop bits `0..2`、parity `0..4` 与 data "
"bits `5/6/7/8/16`；实际 UART 能力与 产品策略可更窄。short DATA 或非法字段不能获批，但仍可显式拒绝。 "
"control-line/break 请求在获批前不准入 STATUS。所有 mutation 都必须由同一 序列化特权 Task 显式 "
"`nx_usb_acm_approve`；true 仅准许后续 STATUS，不提前 修改 committed "
"状态或应用物理线路。审批包含在原绝对 monotonic deadline 内。"
msgstr ""
"`SET_LINE_CODING` first receives seven staged bytes into DATA_READY; "
"`nx_usb_acm_pending` copies values only for external inspection. Shared "
"line-coding format checks accept only nonzero rate, stop bits `0..2`, "
"parity `0..4` and data bits `5/6/7/8/16`; actual UART capabilities and "
"product policy may be narrower. Short DATA or malformed fields cannot be"
" approved, but may still be explicitly rejected. Control-line/break "
"requests do not admit STATUS before approval. Every mutation requires "
"explicit `nx_usb_acm_approve` from the same serialized privileged Task. "
"True permits subsequent STATUS only; it neither changes committed state "
"nor applies physical lines early. Approval remains within the original "
"absolute monotonic deadline."

msgid ""
"只有对应 outer acquire SUCCESS、即真实 STATUS ACK 后，组件才提交批准的 软件意图并更新 "
"`committed_epoch`。新 SETUP/reset/cancel 按既有 packetizer 规则排空，不撤销借用；未获得 "
"outer SUCCESS 的终态不提交。cancel 成功只请求 排空：若撤回 endpoint 前，对应 STATUS 仍获真实 "
"ACK，outer acquire SUCCESS 仍提交已批准的原 epoch 意图。已经 acquire 的 STATUS ACK "
"不被后来的 SETUP/reset、closing 或 state 读取失败撤销，紧接的 GET 返回已提交的新 line "
"coding。reset 后是否恢复 初始类状态是外部 owner 的独立策略。每次 `nx_usb_acm_step` 最多推进一次既有 "
"packetizer，保持每步最多一次 service、一次 state 读取及一次 packet 动作； 外部仍须在取消、超时、suspend"
" 和停机期间继续推进并保留所有 storage。 OUT0 quarantine 仍须外部 controller owner "
"授权真实完整停止，组件不自动 stop。"
msgstr ""
"Only after the matching outer acquire SUCCESS, meaning a real STATUS "
"ACK, does the component commit approved software intent and update "
"`committed_epoch`. New SETUP/reset/cancel drains under the existing "
"packetizer rules without revoking borrows; a terminal outcome without "
"outer SUCCESS does not commit. Successful cancellation only requests "
"drain: if the matching STATUS still receives a real ACK before endpoint "
"withdrawal, outer acquire SUCCESS still commits the approved original "
"epoch intent. An already acquired STATUS ACK is not revoked by later "
"SETUP/reset, closing or a failed state read; an immediately following "
"GET returns the newly committed line coding. Whether reset restores "
"initial class state is separate external owner policy. Each "
"`nx_usb_acm_step` advances the existing packetizer at most once, "
"preserving the per-step bounds of one service, one state read and one "
"packet action. The external executor must continue progress and retain "
"all storage during cancellation, timeout, suspend and shutdown. OUT0 "
"quarantine still requires the external controller owner to authorize "
"real complete stop; the component does not stop it automatically."

msgid ""
"外部在每次 step 后、派发下一请求前读取 snapshot，按新的 `committed_epoch` 应用 UART 参数、DTR/RTS"
" 或 break，并独立处理应用失败与恢复；snapshot 不是事件队列， 软件提交不证明外设已应用。`SEND_BREAK` 仅记录 "
"`0`（停止）、`0xffff`（无限期）或 有限毫秒意图，不建计时器、不自动清除，也不证明物理 break。控制子集不提供 bulk "
"数据搬运、serial-state notification、完整 CDC 枚举、其他类或物理资格。"
msgstr ""
"After each step and before dispatching the next request, the external "
"owner reads the snapshot and uses a new `committed_epoch` to apply UART "
"parameters, DTR/RTS or break, with separate responsibility for "
"application failures and recovery. The snapshot is not an event queue, "
"and software commit does not prove peripheral application. `SEND_BREAK` "
"records only `0` (stop), `0xffff` (indefinite) or a finite millisecond "
"intent; it creates no timer, performs no automatic clearing and does not"
" prove physical break. The control subset provides no bulk data "
"movement, serial-state notification, complete CDC enumeration, other "
"classes or physical qualification."

msgid "两款 SoC 的 USBFS 基址都是 `0x50000000`，四个 IN / 四个 OUT 方向、320-word FIFO， 单一 IRQ 67；绑定用锁定 SDK 验证实际 offset、stride、容量和 W1C/只读位。 EP0 固定 64-byte MPS；bulk MPS 只能是 8/16/32/64。interrupt 仅选入 EP1–EP3 IN，MPS 为 1–64 B，允许 10 B 等非二次幂长度；interrupt OUT 和 ISO 未接入。 RX FIFO 至少 64 words；每个被选 IN FIFO 至少 16 words，分区先验证无重叠且总计 不超过 320 words。方向、类型、MPS、FIFO 与重复 identity 的非法计划在 clock validate／retain 和 MMIO 之前拒绝。"
msgstr "Both SoCs use USBFS base `0x50000000`, four IN / four OUT directions, a 320-word FIFO and IRQ 67. Bindings validate actual offsets, strides, capacity and W1C/read-only bits against locked SDKs. EP0 MPS is fixed at 64 bytes; bulk MPS may only be 8/16/32/64. Interrupt mode selects only EP1–EP3 IN with MPS 1–64 B, including non-power-of-two lengths such as 10 B; interrupt OUT and ISO are not integrated. RX FIFO requires at least 64 words and each selected IN FIFO at least 16 words. Partition validation rejects overlap or totals exceeding 320 words. Invalid direction, type, MPS, FIFO or duplicate-identity plans are rejected before clock validate/retain or MMIO."

msgid "既有 ARM GCC 14.3 的实际 sizeof probe 为：controller 144 B、每个 endpoint 40 B、 每个 event 40 B、request 56 B，STM/GD clock state 分别 8/16 B。生产单元的 ARM objects 无全局 `.data`/`.bss`；完整 ELF 的未选 GC/资源变化由实际装配构建另行证明。 这些既有 DCD 尺寸不包含可选 ROM profile、EP0 adapter 或调用者的 outer request； 新增组件的 Flash／RAM 成本需以同源 ARM ELF 与实际 ABI 分别确认。私有 endpoint 用 `uint8_t transfer` 替换原单字节 `bulk`，没有新增 interval、调度或队列字段； 字段宽度保持一字节，不以 host sizeof 或历史 probe 代替新镜像的 ARM 成本测量。"
msgstr "An existing actual ARM GCC 14.3 sizeof probe reports: controller 144 B, each endpoint 40 B, each event 40 B, request 56 B, and STM/GD clock state 8/16 B respectively. The production-unit ARM objects have no global `.data`/`.bss`; garbage collection of unselected code and resource changes in a complete ELF must be established separately by an actual assembly build. These existing DCD sizes exclude the optional ROM profile, EP0 adapter and caller-provided outer request; the added components' Flash/RAM costs require separate confirmation using an ARM ELF built from the same source and the actual ABI. Private endpoints replace the former single-byte `bulk` with `uint8_t transfer`, adding no interval, scheduling or queue fields. The selector remains one byte; host sizeof or historical probes do not substitute for ARM cost measurements of the new image."

msgid "`nexus/io/usb_profile.h` 的只读 profile 绑定既有 controller／endpoint face，以及 选定的方向、类型、MPS、FIFO、48 MHz、internal PHY、FS device 与 PIO 事实。 只有 USB 被选入且 `factory.capabilities = true` 时，生成器才产生 profile、精确 endpoint 数组与 `nx_factory_usb_profile` getter。设为 `false` 时不生成这些对象 或 getter；普通 USB face、方法表、provider context 与既有 generic capability 类型不因此扩大。getter 不初始化硬件，也不发现新 endpoint。 装配在既有 `transfer` 字段增加 `\"interrupt\"` 取值；不可变 IR 与公共 profile 字段不变。 公共 `NX_USB_PROFILE_INTERRUPT` 的枚举值是 2，USB wire／寄存器 EPTYP 值是 3； provider 显式映射类型，不把两者直接强转混用。"
msgstr "The read-only profile in `nexus/io/usb_profile.h` binds existing controller/endpoint faces and the selected direction, type, MPS, FIFO, 48 MHz, internal PHY, FS device and PIO facts. The generator emits the profile, exact endpoint array and `nx_factory_usb_profile` getter only when USB is selected and `factory.capabilities = true`. With `false`, it emits none of these objects or the getter; ordinary USB faces, method tables, provider contexts and existing generic capability types do not grow as a result. The getter neither initializes hardware nor discovers new endpoints. Assembly adds the value `\"interrupt\"` to the existing `transfer` field; immutable IR and public profile fields remain unchanged. Public `NX_USB_PROFILE_INTERRUPT` has enum value 2, whereas USB wire/register EPTYP is 3. The provider explicitly maps the types rather than casting between them."

msgid "`nx_usb_profile_validate` 只读检查选定事实，不能证明实际时钟、PCB、VBUS 或枚举。 外部 descriptor 通过 `nx_usb_descriptor_view_t` 传给 `nx_usb_descriptor_validate`：device、configuration、string 必须完整；校验 length／total、EP0 MPS、唯一 interface、alternate 0，以及 bulk／interrupt IN endpoint 的方向／编号／类型／MPS 与选定 profile 的对应关系。interrupt 描述符的 `bInterval` 必须是 1–255 个 full-speed 1 ms frame 的线性计数，零无效；它由外部 描述符独占，不复制到 TOML、IR、profile 或 provider state。DCD 不调度 host poll， 也不承诺实际间隔；bulk 的既有 interval 处理保持不变。选定类型不符、描述的 endpoint 未选入 profile 或 MPS 不符返回 INVALID；interrupt OUT、ISO、非零 control 与 alternate setting 仍为 UNSUPPORTED，保留字段非法仍为 INVALID。class-specific 子结构只检查边界， 不解码其类语义。"
msgstr "`nx_usb_profile_validate` checks selected facts read-only; it cannot prove actual clocks, PCB, VBUS or enumeration. External descriptors reach `nx_usb_descriptor_validate` through `nx_usb_descriptor_view_t`: device, configuration and string views must be complete. Validation checks lengths/totals, EP0 MPS, unique interfaces, alternate zero, and the correspondence of bulk/interrupt IN endpoint direction, number, type and MPS with the selected profile. An interrupt descriptor's `bInterval` must be a linear count of 1–255 full-speed 1 ms frames; zero is invalid. External descriptor bytes alone own it: it is not copied into TOML, IR, profiles or provider state. DCD neither schedules host polls nor promises actual intervals; existing bulk interval handling remains unchanged. A selected-type mismatch, a described endpoint absent from the selected profile or an MPS mismatch returns INVALID. Interrupt OUT, ISO, nonzero control and alternate settings remain UNSUPPORTED; invalid reserved fields remain INVALID. Class-specific subordinate records are bounds-checked without decoding class semantics."

msgid "IN 的每次有限 data／ZLP 的长度寄存器写入 `(1U << 19) | length`（PKTCNT=1）， MCNT／保留高位保持零，interrupt 不增加 odd/even-frame 命令。 每个选定 IN direction 使用独立 Tx FIFO， 一次同步装入整个不超过 64 B 的包，没有剩余软件 refill 工作；TX-empty mask 保持零， 不创建 TXFE refill worker。IN FIFO 写入不是完成，只有 XFRC、EP enable 已清、 FIFO 空闲容量恢复并且观察到的 W1C completion 清除读回成功才发布 SUCCESS。 OUT 必须同时读到包数据和 XFRC， short packet 正常完成；越界包的所有 FIFO words 都被消费，最多复制 caller capacity， 之后报告 OVERFLOW 并排空，不越界写 caller buffer。"
msgstr "Each finite IN data/ZLP writes `(1U << 19) | length` to the length register (PKTCNT=1), keeping MCNT/reserved high bits zero; interrupt mode adds no odd/even-frame commands. Every selected IN direction uses a dedicated Tx FIFO. The entire packet of at most 64 B is loaded synchronously, leaving no software refill work; the TX-empty mask stays zero and no TXFE refill worker is created. Writing IN FIFO is not completion. SUCCESS requires XFRC, cleared EP enable, restored FIFO free capacity and successful observed-W1C-completion clear readback. OUT requires both packet data and XFRC; short packets complete normally. Oversized packets consume every FIFO word, copy at most caller capacity, then report OVERFLOW and drain, never writing outside caller buffers."

msgid "IN TXFE 是只读状态，不参与 W1C 清除/完成的零值证明。ITTXFE 是主机 IN token 在 FIFO 尚空时到达的可重试信息，OUT STUP 是正常 SETUP phase 事实；两者不错误地终止 包。IN control timeout 和 OUT FIFO overrun 使用对应方向的真实事件位。EP0 的 DATA PID 由 SETUP/core 管理：bits 29:28/16 对 EP0 是 reserved，软件只对非零 bulk／interrupt endpoint 使用 DATA0 命令。reset／clear-halt 必须核对 DATA0 读回；失败保留 reset admission 屏障或 halt，不提前允许新包借用。"
msgstr "IN TXFE is read-only and contributes neither W1C clearing nor zero-value completion proof. ITTXFE means a retryable host IN token arrived while FIFO was empty; OUT STUP is normal SETUP phase. Neither incorrectly terminates packets. IN control timeout and OUT FIFO overrun use real direction-specific event bits. SETUP/core owns EP0 DATA PID: bits 29:28/16 are reserved on EP0, so software uses DATA0 commands only on nonzero bulk/interrupt endpoints. Reset/clear-halt must check DATA0 readback; failure retains the reset admission barrier or halt instead of admitting a new packet loan early."

msgid "既有 DCD 开发证据在 `tools/testing/evidence/usb-device-iteration/manifest.json`， 绑定原 Native 43、STM32 7、GD32 7 个 Google cases 以及 ASan/UBSan 同 57 cases、 零 skip 的执行； 两家实际 SDK 的六个 production ARM 单元通过 strict C11 编译。对应 clock owner 的 27 个独立 cases 保留在 `usb-clock-iteration`，不重复计入 DCD 57。历史模型的 错误 TXFE/EP0/PID 假设和失败日志保留，最新源与旧报告的身份不混用。 这些历史计数不覆盖新增 profile、descriptor helper、EP0 packetizer 或 interrupt IN。 新增量的开发证据分别记录 ROM profile、descriptor、control 与软件 epoch 的真实回归、 对齐反例 RED→修正后的 focused GREEN，以及精确 ARM 装配的编译与链接。 每份结果只描述对应源码与命令；用例明细及失败尝试见该批原始回执。 focused GREEN 与 ARM 链接不建立 clean SDK 或完整 Native 候选资格；SDK consumer、资源、双语文档与普通完整提交门禁仍须分别验证。"
msgstr "Existing DCD development evidence in `tools/testing/evidence/usb-device-iteration/manifest.json` binds the original Native 43, STM32 7 and GD32 7 Google cases, plus execution of the same 57 cases under ASan/UBSan with zero skips; six production ARM units using the two vendors' actual SDKs passed strict C11 compilation. The corresponding clock owner's 27 independent cases remain in `usb-clock-iteration` and are not counted again in DCD 57. Historical incorrect TXFE/EP0/PID assumptions and failure logs are retained; current source identities are kept separate from old reports. These historical counts do not cover the added profile, descriptor helper, EP0 packetizer or interrupt IN. Development evidence for the additions separately records actual regressions for ROM profile, descriptor, control and software epochs, alignment counterexamples RED→corrected focused GREEN, and compilation and linking of exact ARM assemblies. Each result describes only its associated source and command; case details and failed attempts are in that batch's raw receipts. focused GREEN and ARM linking do not establish clean SDK or full Native candidate qualification; SDK consumers, resources, bilingual documentation and the ordinary complete-index commit gates must still be verified separately."

msgid "资料是锁定 ST CMSIS header 的 FS 寄存器事实，以及 GD32F4xx User Manual Rev3.3 §28.7.3（DIEPxCTL printed p988–990、DIEPxINTF p994–995、DIEPxLEN p998） 和 §4.3.24/26 的 PLLSAI/CK48。Rev3.3 的 chapter 28 是 USBFS，chapter 29 是 USBHS；这里只修正当前引用，历史证据保留原始字节。 GD 手册 SHA256 是 `c8e1d20d7cde338892d08dcb233345e03f7960256a60a36c755c576d9cd65c13`。 完整出处身份绑定在 manifest。"
msgstr "Sources are the FS register facts in the locked ST CMSIS header and GD32F4xx User Manual Rev3.3 §28.7.3 (DIEPxCTL printed pp988–990, DIEPxINTF pp994–995 and DIEPxLEN p998), plus PLLSAI/CK48 in §4.3.24/26. In Rev3.3, chapter 28 is USBFS and chapter 29 is USBHS. Only current citations are corrected here; historical evidence keeps its original bytes. The GD manual SHA256 is `c8e1d20d7cde338892d08dcb233345e03f7960256a60a36c755c576d9cd65c13`. Complete source identities are bound in the manifest."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:3
msgid "公共接口是 `nexus/io/usb_device.h`。当前纵切片提供 Native、STM32F407 和 GD32F470 的 internal-PHY full-speed device PIO 机制及实际 SDK 绑定。维护范围是 EP0 control、显式选择的 EP1–EP3 bulk IN/OUT 与 interrupt IN、 SETUP/reset/suspend/resume 事实、STALL、SET_ADDRESS、取消与退出。 DCD 的一次 request 仍是一个不超过 MPS 的包；非零 endpoint 的 active／mask 由 独立可选 activation face 显式控制。SET_CONFIGURATION、配置就绪及其回滚由外部 Chapter 9 owner 负责，packet 机制不能单独证明完整枚举／物理 reset 恢复。 可选 `Nexus::USBControl` 组合 EP0 多包 DATA、必要 ZLP 与 STATUS；独立的 `Nexus::USBDescriptors` 校验外部描述符结构。两者不创建任务或分配内存。 具体 class 分派、描述符字节与查找、VID/PID、字符串、配置及恢复策略由外部工程提供。 可选 `Nexus::USBACM` 只组合下述 CDC ACM 控制子集；没有数据泵或完整 CDC/HID 类栈， 也不增加 Host、HS、DMA、ISO 或 remote wake 支持。"
msgstr "The public interface is `nexus/io/usb_device.h`. The current slice provides internal-PHY full-speed device PIO mechanisms for Native, STM32F407 and GD32F470, with actual SDK bindings. Its maintained scope covers EP0 control, explicitly selected EP1–EP3 bulk IN/OUT and interrupt IN, SETUP/reset/suspend/resume facts, STALL, SET_ADDRESS, cancellation and exit. One DCD request remains one packet no larger than MPS. A separate optional activation face explicitly controls nonzero endpoint active state and interrupt masks. The external Chapter 9 owner supplies SET_CONFIGURATION, configured readiness and rollback; packet mechanisms alone do not prove complete enumeration or physical reset recovery. Optional `Nexus::USBControl` composes EP0 multipacket DATA, necessary ZLP and STATUS; the separate `Nexus::USBDescriptors` validates external descriptor structure. Neither creates tasks or allocates memory. External projects supply class dispatch, descriptor bytes and lookup, VID/PID, strings, configuration and recovery policy. Optional `Nexus::USBACM` composes only the CDC ACM control subset below; it provides no data pump or complete CDC/HID class stack, nor Host, HS, DMA, ISO or remote wake support."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:109
msgid "SETUP 严格解码八个 little-endian bytes，并产生单调递增 epoch。新 SETUP/reset 使旧 control loan 进入排空，不能仅改 epoch 就撤销借用。reset 与 queued SETUP 在同一 snapshot 中没有先后证明，先前 queued SETUP 被丢弃；reset 在旧 loan 排空和 FIFO flush 后， 还须显式屏蔽并清除两系列选定非零方向的 active，读回成功才清 `reset_pending`。 失败保留 reset 屏障和 clock，由 service 或完整 stop 继续恢复。新 admission 仍须 满足 endpoint 的实际启用条件。SET_ADDRESS 验证 当前标准 SETUP 的各字段，先 staged，只有对应 status-IN 实际 XFRC 后写 DCFG 地址。地址读回失败关闭 controller。"
msgstr "SETUP strictly decodes eight little-endian bytes and generates monotonically increasing epochs. New SETUP/reset makes old control loans drain; changing an epoch cannot revoke a borrow. Reset and queued SETUP in one snapshot have no proven order, so previously queued SETUP is discarded. After old loans drain and FIFOs are flushed, reset must also explicitly mask and clear active state on the selected nonzero directions of both families. Only successful readback clears `reset_pending`. Failure retains the reset barrier and clock; service or full stop continues recovery. New admission still requires the endpoint to be active in hardware. SET_ADDRESS validates every field of the current standard SETUP, stages the address and writes DCFG only after actual XFRC of the corresponding status-IN. Address readback failure closes the controller."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:118
msgid "STM32F407 总线 reset 清除非零 endpoint 的 USBAEP，模型保留这个硬件事实； GD 自动清 EPACT 尚无已核实依据。公共生产路径在 loan 排空后主动清两系列非零 active／mask，形成统一的平台后置条件，不把它归因为 GD 的自动硬件行为。GD 回归须保留硬件 active，再证明公共代码实际清除。完成 reset 后仍需以新当前 epoch 显式 enable；reset／clear-halt／submit 均不自动激活。对 inactive 非零 endpoint， submit 返回 STATE，prepared request 保持 READY，没有新 request／buffer 借用或 FIFO 写入。EP0 control 保留既有合同；DATA0 恢复、reset 事件或 controller 未 closing 均不能证明外部 configuration 已提交。"
msgstr "STM32F407 bus reset clears USBAEP on nonzero endpoints; the model preserves this hardware fact. Automatic EPACT clearing on GD has not been verified. After loans drain, the common production path clears nonzero active state and masks those directions on both families. This is a uniform platform postcondition, not an assertion of automatic GD hardware behavior. The GD regression must leave hardware active and prove that common code actually clears it. Completed reset still requires explicit enable with the new current epoch; reset, clear-halt and submit never activate endpoints automatically. Submitting to an inactive nonzero endpoint returns STATE, leaves the prepared request READY and creates no new request/buffer borrow or FIFO write. EP0 control retains its existing contract; DATA0 recovery, a reset event or a controller that is not closing does not prove an external configuration has been committed."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:131
msgid "非零 endpoint 显式 activation"
msgstr "Explicit nonzero endpoint activation"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:133
msgid "独立的 `nexus/io/usb_activation.h` 提供 `nx_usb_activation_port_t`：face 是共享 只读 ops 与既有 controller context 两指针，只提供一个同步 `nx_usb_activation_set(port, epoch, endpoint_address, active)` 操作。生成的 `nx_factory_usb_activation(nx_usb_device_id_t)` 返回选定 controller 的静态借用 face，非法或不支持的 identity 返回 NULL；查找不初始化硬件、不 retain clock。 生成独立于 `factory.capabilities`，不要求启用 ROM profile，不改变既有 USB ops、 profile、face 布局或 factory ABI epoch 1。该机制不新增可变 controller／endpoint 状态、队列、worker、实例池、动态分配、TOML 字段或 IR 类型。两指针布局说明 face 形状；实际只读保留成本、未引用 GC 与完整镜像成本须分别以对应 ARM ELF 确认。"
msgstr "The separate `nexus/io/usb_activation.h` provides `nx_usb_activation_port_t`: a two-pointer face containing shared read-only ops and the existing controller context, with one synchronous `nx_usb_activation_set(port, epoch, endpoint_address, active)` operation. Generated `nx_factory_usb_activation(nx_usb_device_id_t)` returns a static borrowed face for the selected controller, or NULL for an invalid or unsupported identity. Lookup neither initializes hardware nor retains the clock. Generation is independent of `factory.capabilities`, needs no ROM profile and changes no existing USB ops, profile or face layout, or factory ABI epoch 1. The mechanism adds no mutable controller/endpoint state, queue, worker, instance pool, dynamic allocation, TOML field or IR type. The two-pointer layout describes the face shape; retained read-only cost, unreferenced GC and complete-image cost require separate evidence from the corresponding ARM ELF."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:143
msgid "操作只面向已经选定的 EP1–EP3 某一个方向，拒绝两个 EP0 地址及保留／未选地址； OUT 仍只允许既有 bulk。调用者须是同一个序列化特权 Task，进入时 incoming IRQ masks clear。controller 须 started、持有 clock、没有 closing／reset 屏障，参数 `epoch` 等于最新权威软件 control/reset epoch；冷态 epoch 0 合法。无效 identity 或已知旧软件 epoch 在 MMIO 前拒绝。软件检查通过后，已观察到的 raw USBRST 也使本次调用在写入前返回 STATE。尚未采集的物理 SETUP/reset 仍可能随后发生， IRQ 临界区不提供总线原子性；stop/restart 后外部须丢弃旧缓存的 epoch。"
msgstr "The operation addresses one already selected EP1–EP3 direction. Both EP0 addresses and reserved or unselected addresses are rejected; OUT still supports only existing bulk mode. The caller must be the same serialized privileged Task with incoming IRQ masks clear. The controller must be started, retain its clock and have no closing/reset barrier. The `epoch` argument must equal the latest authoritative software control/reset epoch; cold epoch 0 is valid. Invalid identities and already-known stale software epochs reject before MMIO. After software checks pass, an observed raw USBRST also returns STATE before writes. A physical SETUP/reset not yet acquired may still arrive later; the IRQ guard is not a wire-atomic transaction. External callers must discard cached epochs after stop/restart."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:151
msgid "目标方向必须没有 request loan、disable 工作、EPENA、待确认的定义事件或尚未完成的 SETUP 清理。IN 还要求专用 FIFO 全空且没有 flush；OUT 要求共享 RX status FIFO 空。 否则返回 BUSY，不暗中取消请求、消费其他方向的 RX 或释放其存储。前置检查返回 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE／BUSY 时没有硬件写入，不建立新 loan；激活本身从不借用 request 或 payload，不能代替已有 packet 的 cancel／drain／acquire SETTLED。"
msgstr "The target direction must have no request loan, disable work, EPENA, unacknowledged defined event or unfinished SETUP cleanup. IN also requires its dedicated FIFO fully free and no flush; OUT requires the shared RX status FIFO empty. Otherwise the operation returns BUSY without implicitly cancelling requests, consuming another direction's RX or releasing its storage. INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY preflight rejection performs no hardware writes and creates no new loan. Activation itself never borrows a request or payload and cannot replace an existing packet's cancel/drain/acquire SETTLED."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:157
msgid "冷启动仅使两个 EP0 方向 active 并解除其 endpoint mask；其余选定方向保留 immutable 几何但 inactive／SNAK。使能一个 inactive 方向时，先按选定 MPS、wire 类型和仅 IN 的 FIFO selector 配置目标，建立 DATA0、清 STALL、置 active 与 SNAK， 保持 EPENA clear，不写 TSIZ 或 payload FIFO。核对稳定控制字段、DATA0 与 NAK， 仅处理命令后新出现的目标 IN NAK-effective／token-empty 提示（0x50），并证明其 W1C 清除；其他新事件使本次操作失败，进入 partial IO／closing。调用前已有的 定义事件仍返回 BUSY，不在前置拒绝中清除。随后解除目标 EP_MASK 位并读回完整 预期 mask。OUT 不写 reserved TxFIFO 字段。active、传输使能与 IRQ mask 是三个独立条件；mask 或 active 单独成立均不代表已经接受一个包。"
msgstr "Cold start activates and unmasks only the two EP0 directions. Other selected directions retain immutable geometry but remain inactive/SNAK. Enabling an inactive direction first applies its selected MPS and wire type, and the FIFO selector for IN only, establishes DATA0, clears STALL and sets active/SNAK. It leaves EPENA clear and writes neither TSIZ nor the payload FIFO. It proves stable control fields, DATA0 and NAK, then handles only new target IN NAK-effective/token-empty hints (0x50) arising after the command and proves their W1C clear. Any other new event fails the operation with partial IO/closing. Defined events already present on entry still return BUSY and are not cleared during preflight rejection. It then unmasks the target EP_MASK bit and reads back the complete expected mask. OUT never writes reserved TxFIFO fields. Active state, transfer enable and IRQ masking are independent conditions; a mask or active bit alone does not mean a packet was admitted."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:167
msgid "反激活之前，外部必须实际 cancel／drain 并 acquire 目标 packet 的 SETTLED。 操作先屏蔽目标方向且核对其他 mask 位未变，再设置 SNAK、清 active 并核对。 每次仅修改对应方向，保留其他 endpoint 和两个 EP0 位，物理 vector／priority route 不变；不 flush 共享 RX、不重置 controller、不停止 clock，也不开始传输。 Task 显式操作在既有有限 poll budget 内等待控制／W1C 读回，每项命令只发一次； reset progress 新增的反激活步骤只单次观察，由后续 service 继续，不在 IRQ 引入 此 Task 等待循环。"
msgstr "Before deactivation, the external owner must actually cancel/drain and acquire SETTLED for the target packet. The operation first masks the target direction and proves other mask bits unchanged, then sets SNAK, clears active and reads back the result. Each call changes only its direction, preserving other endpoints and both EP0 bits; physical vector/priority routing stays fixed. It neither flushes shared RX, resets the controller, stops the clock nor starts a transfer. Explicit Task operations wait for control/W1C readback within the existing finite poll budget, issuing each command once. The added reset-progress deactivation step makes one observation and relies on later service to continue; it does not introduce this Task wait loop into IRQ execution."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:175
msgid "幂等调用必须先满足同样的无 loan／无 pending 前置条件。已经 active 的 enable 先核对 immutable 几何，不重放控制寄存器配置，只按需修正目标 mask；重复 enable 不得把 DATA1 重置为 DATA0、清除真实 HALT 或发送包。已经 inactive 的 disable 不重新编程几何，只证明目标 mask 关闭及事件清除。只有显式 disable 后重新 enable 才建立新 DATA0 并在读回成功后清 halt；disable 保留 PID。已 active 但 immutable 几何损坏时返回 IO／closing，不通过重写控制寄存器掩盖错误。"
msgstr "Idempotent calls require the same no-loan/no-pending preflight. Enable on an already active direction first validates immutable geometry, does not replay control-register configuration and only repairs the target mask if needed. Repeated enable must not reset DATA1 to DATA0, clear a real HALT or send a packet. Disable on an already inactive direction does not reprogram geometry; it only proves the target mask is off and events are clear. Only explicit disable followed by enable establishes fresh DATA0 and clears halt after successful readback; disable preserves PID. Corrupt immutable geometry on an active direction returns IO/closing without concealing the fault by rewriting control registers."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:182
msgid "控制或 mask 写入后的读回失败返回 IO，并保留既有 `closing` 屏障；IO 可以已有 部分硬件效果，不能作为无操作拒绝。只对目标 best-effort mask／inactive 回滚， 若观察到 EPENA 意外为一，不能假装写零已完成 disable。失败不能通过重试 activation 清 closing；外部须继续推进其他 loan 并执行显式完整 stop。stop 仍可能 BUSY， 在既有 disable／flush／IRQ join 证明完成前保留 clock 与 caller storage。"
msgstr "Failed readback after a control or mask write returns IO and retains the existing `closing` barrier. IO may already have partial hardware effects; it is not a no-operation rejection. Best-effort mask/inactive rollback affects only the target. If EPENA is unexpectedly observed set, writing zero cannot pretend disable has completed. Retrying activation cannot clear closing. The external owner must continue progressing other loans and perform explicit full stop. Stop may still return BUSY, retaining the clock and caller storage until existing disable/flush/IRQ-join proofs complete."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:188
msgid "外部 Chapter 9/configuration owner 根据配置或 alternate 选择方向，先 cancel／ drain／disable 旧方向，再 stage 新方向，随后提交该请求的 STATUS IN。这与 ST 手册及参考 Zephyr 的 before-status 顺序一致，不强制解释为 ACK 后才可激活。 外部仅在对应实际 STATUS 完成且仍满足当前事务条件后发布 configured readiness， 此前自行阻止普通非零 packet admission。多次 setter 不是配置事务：后续失败、 新 SETUP supersede 或 status 失败时，外部须撤销已经成功的 staging 或显式 stop； 不能用平台 rollback 撤销主机已观察到的 ACK。去配置也须先实际排空／反激活， 再按外部 deadline 与拒绝策略决定是否接受；DCD 不解码 configuration value。"
msgstr "The external Chapter 9/configuration owner chooses directions for the configuration or alternate setting, cancels/drains/disables old directions, stages new directions and then submits STATUS IN for that request. This matches the before-status sequence in the ST manual and reference Zephyr; it does not impose activation only after ACK. The external owner publishes configured readiness only after actual corresponding STATUS completion and while the current transaction conditions still hold, and must gate ordinary nonzero packet admission beforehand. Several setter calls are not a configuration transaction. On a later failure, superseding SETUP or failed status, the owner must undo successful staging or explicitly stop. Platform rollback cannot revoke an ACK already observed by the host. Deconfiguration also requires actual drain/deactivation before the external deadline/rejection policy decides whether to accept; the DCD does not decode configuration values."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:197
msgid "activation 补充既有 FIG-16 的显式控制调用，不新增生命周期 owner 或执行线程。 它不提供 Chapter 9／class stack、CDC notification、多配置／alternate 策略、 连续传输、DMA、ISO、interrupt OUT、HS／Host／OTG 或电气接入；软件机制不证明 物理枚举／reset 时序、完整 IO-35 退出、clean candidate 或 HIL。"
msgstr "Activation adds an explicit control call to existing FIG-16 without a new lifecycle owner or execution thread. It supplies no Chapter 9/class stack, CDC notification, multiple-configuration/alternate policy, continuous transfer, DMA, ISO, interrupt OUT, HS/Host/OTG or electrical integration. Software mechanisms do not prove physical enumeration/reset timing, full IO-35 exit, a clean candidate or HIL."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/usb-device.md:349
msgid "IO-35 的完整退出仍开放；有限 interrupt IN 与显式 activation 不提供 notification 策略、完整 Chapter 9／class stack、外部配置事务或物理 reset 恢复资格。它们不建立 clean software candidate、产品 release 或物理资格。三块 PCB 的 USB role、 VBUS sensing/power/backfeed、pull-up/ESD、电气跳帽、pin lease 与共享引脚冲突尚需 独立 reviewed Board 装配；本批没有配置这些引脚。枚举、主机重试、reset/拔线、 传输错误、PHY 三周期 flush 时序和实际 ISR/WCET/HIL 均未执行，不继承旧例程测试。"
msgstr "The full IO-35 exit remains open. Finite interrupt IN and explicit activation supply no notification policy, complete Chapter 9/class stack, external configuration transaction or physical reset-recovery qualification. They establish neither a clean software candidate, product release nor physical qualification. USB role, VBUS sensing/power/backfeed, pull-up/ESD, electrical jumpers, pin leases and shared-pin conflicts for the three PCBs still require independently reviewed Board assemblies; this batch configures none of those pins. Enumeration, host retries, reset/unplug, transfer errors, PHY three-cycle flush timing and actual ISR/WCET/HIL have not been executed; old example tests confer no qualification."
